
# Write your commit message here.
#
#   <type>[optional scope][!]: <subject>
#
# Types: feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | build | ci | chore | revert
# Use at most 72 Unicode characters in the complete subject line.
# Use the imperative mood and lowercase except identifiers.
# Add ! after the type or scope for breaking changes, and describe the break in a
# BREAKING CHANGE: footer in the body.
